  WrittenDialogue: "I’ve been with the church for a couple years and had no clue how much sin I was truly in.\nA lot of things your friends at school talk about could really confuse you.\nSo it’s my job as a counselor of Christ to help you make sense of things.\nNo one is mad at you. Your parents only want you here to get better. To be fixed.\nHaving urges for the same sex will only stray you further from God.\nMaybe you’re just too shy to talk to the other side?\nI know it can be scary but hell is a lot scarier. We don’t want you to go there, sweetie.\nBeing gay is not okay. If the lord struck you down for sodomy I would cry for you.\nTears of joy that is, we celebrate the death of sinners here.\nSo let’s start at the beginning. What was the origin of these misled thoughts of the same sex?"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
